sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Process P
    participant L as Condition lock
    participant PL as P lock
    participant S as Scheduler
    participant W as Waker
    P->>PL: acquire(p->lock)
    P->>L: release(condition lock)
    P->>P: chan=key; state=SLEEPING
    P->>S: sched() / swtch
    W->>PL: acquire(p->lock)
    W->>P: state=RUNNABLE
    W->>PL: release(p->lock)
    S-->>P: resume; reacquire condition lock
